@startuml
title A1 - Eskalacija obvestila

actor "Administrator" as Admin
boundary "AdminObvestilaMaska" as UI
control "AdminObvestilaKontroler" as Controller
entity "Prijave/Kontakti" as Notifications

Admin -> UI: odpre sekcijo "Obvestila"
activate UI

UI -> Controller: pridobiSeznamObvestil(...)
activate Controller
Controller --> UI: seznam
deactivate Controller
UI --> Admin: prikaže seznam

Admin -> UI: odpre obvestilo visoke prioritete

UI -> Controller: pridobiPodrobnostiObvestila(...)
activate Controller
Controller -> Notifications: najdiObvestilo(...)
activate Notifications
Notifications --> Controller: podrobnosti
deactivate Notifications
Controller --> UI: podrobnosti
deactivate Controller

UI --> Admin: prikaže podrobnosti

Admin -> UI: izbere "Eskaliraj"

UI -> Controller: eskalirajObvestilo(obvestiloId)
activate Controller
Controller -> Notifications: označiKotEskalirano(obvestiloId)
activate Notifications
Notifications --> Controller: posodobljeno
deactivate Notifications

Controller --> UI: uspeh
deactivate Controller

UI --> Admin: osvežen seznam (status eskalirano)

deactivate UI
@enduml